// QuicBaaS Unified Login Ceremony Protocol Buffer Definitions v1
//
// The unified login ceremony (BeginLogin / FinishLogin) is owned by the
// embedded go-qrdb node; QuicBaaS exposes a thin gRPC facade so gRPC-only
// clients dialling the QuicBaaS endpoint can drive the ceremony against the
// composed stack. The shape mirrors go-qrdb transport.BeginLogin* /
// FinishLogin* and the LoginCeremony() service-layer facade.
//
// SECURITY: for an mtls factor the server DERIVES the lookup key from the
// verified TLS peer certificate; the lookup_key field on FinishLoginRequest is
// IGNORED for mtls over a network transport (the client cannot spoof another
// certificate's identity). See pkg/service/login_service.go.
